  "title": "Panettone",
  "description": "Panettone is a sweet Italian bread that&#39;s traditionally eaten at Christmas. This recipe makes 3 fluffy panettone loaves studded with candied fruit.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-01-17T00:21:09-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-12-09T13:45:01-05:00",
